{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01YLwYL5ie4SzsQRXjFV1oXp", "type": "tool_result", "content": "Web search results for query: \"Skerryvore lighthouse height\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"en.wikipedia.com\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.com/wiki/Skerryvore\"},{\"title\":\"Skerryvore\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skerryvore\"},{\"title\":\"Pricing Change\",\"url\":\"https://canmore.org.uk/site/21407\"},{\"title\":\"wikiwand.com\",\"url\":\"https://wikiwand.com/EN/Skerryvore\"},{\"title\":\"origin-production.wikiwand.com\",\"url\":\"https://origin-production.wikiwand.com/en/Skerryvore\"},{\"title\":\"www.geograph.org.uk\",\"url\":\"https://www.geograph.org.uk/photo/6888730\"},{\"title\":\"skerryvore poi:7953\",\"url\":\"https://travel.sygic.com/en/poi/skerryvore-poi:7953\"},{\"title\":\"canmore.org.uk\",\"url\":\"https://canmore.org.uk/event/855050\"},{\"title\":\"Skerryvore Lighthouse\",\"url\":\"https://lighthouseaccommodation.co.uk/listings/skerryvore-lighthouse/\"},{\"title\":\"djo.org.uk\",\"url\":\"https://djo.org.uk/household-words/volume-ii/page-378.html\"},{\"title\":\"www.scottish-places.info\",\"url\":\"https://www.scottish-places.info/features/featurefirst6484.html\"},{\"title\":\"Monuments: Skerryvore Lighthouse\",\"url\":\"https://www.historytoday.com/node/46935\"},{\"title\":\"wikipedia.classicistranieri.com\",\"url\":\"https://wikipedia.classicistranieri.com/en/articles/s/k/e/Skerryvore.html\"},{\"title\":\"Dubh Artach\",\"url\":\"https://Www.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dubh_Artach\"},{\"title\":\"पुराने ब्राउज़र का शीर्षक\",\"url\":\"https://www.marinetraffic.com/hi/ais/details/lights/1000004781/light_name:Skerryvore\"},{\"title\":\"Managing Organization: Northern Lighthouse Board\",\"url\":\"https://foghornpublishing.com/Digest/database/uniquelighthouse.cfm?value=1816\"},{\"title\":\"lighthouses, travel by sea\",\"url\":\"https://coast.scot/stories/hynish-assembly-station/\"},{\"title\":\"www.scottish-people.info\",\"url\":\"https://www.scottish-people.info/features/featurehistory6484.html\"},{\"title\":\"www.lighthousedepot.com\",\"url\":\"https://www.lighthousedepot.com/database/uniquelighthouse.cfm?value=1816\"},{\"title\":\"www.aniodhlann.org.uk\",\"url\":\"https://www.aniodhlann.org.uk/object/2004-118-6/\"},{\"title\":\"booksfromscotland.com\",\"url\":\"https://booksfromscotland.com/?p=40413\"},{\"title\":\"thegreatbritainguide.com\",\"url\":\"https://thegreatbritainguide.com/place/skerryvore/\"},{\"title\":\"Featured: The Lighthouse Mapping Project - > Explore the Interactive Lighthouse Map\",\"url\":\"https://chanceht.org/?p=5774\"},{\"title\":\"gutenberg.org\",\"url\":\"https://gutenberg.org/ebooks/75213.epub.noimages\"},{\"title\":\"MHG25228 - Ardnamurchan Lighthouse\",\"url\":\"https://her.highland.gov.uk/Monument/MHG25228\"},{\"title\":\"*** START OF THE PROJECT GUTENBERG EBOOK 75213 ***\",\"url\":\"https://gutenberg.org/files/75213/75213-h/75213-h.htm\"},{\"title\":\"Category:Skerryvore Lighthouse\",\"url\":\"https://download.osmand.net/wiki/Category:Skerryvore_Lighthouse\"},{\"title\":\"Jump to content\",\"url\":\"https://wiki.riteme.site/wiki/Portal:Scotland/Selected_article/Week_18,_2010\"},{\"title\":\"We don't have any photos of this building yet. Why don't you be the first to send us one?\",\"url\":\"https://britishlistedbuildings.co.uk/200351832\"},{\"title\":\"gptkb.org\",\"url\":\"https://gptkb.org/entity/Skerryvore\"}]\n\nThe most common figure is about 48 metres (156 feet). Sources differ, mostly because of older measurements and the difference between tower height and focal height.\n\n- **Modern figure:** Several sources put the tower at 156 feet (48 m), which makes it the tallest lighthouse in Scotland. One of them, Skerryvore & its lighthouse :: NL8426, notes it is only about 5 feet shorter than Bishop Rock, Britain's tallest.\n- **Focal height:** One source gives a focal height of 151' (46m).\n- **Other figures:** A Northern Lighthouse Board-based database lists a Tower Height: 158 with a focal plane of 150, which likely uses different units or a different measuring point.\n- **Historic figures:** An 1840s-era account gives the tower as one hundred and thirty-eight feet, six inches, and a Canmore record cites 138ft (42m). These are likely original construction heights that predate later changes to the tower.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "uuid": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "timestamp": "2026-11-26T19:30:13.058Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Skerryvore lighthouse height", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_012RKoD3GLELa2fXz98xAMX6", "content": [{"title": "en.wikipedia.com", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.com/wiki/Skerryvore"}, {"title": "Skerryvore", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Skerryvore"}, {"title": "Pricing Change", "url": "https://canmore.org.uk/site/21407"}, {"title": "wikiwand.com", "url": "https://wikiwand.com/EN/Skerryvore"}, {"title": "origin-production.wikiwand.com", "url": "https://origin-production.wikiwand.com/en/Skerryvore"}, {"title": "www.geograph.org.uk", "url": "https://www.geograph.org.uk/photo/6888730"}, {"title": "skerryvore poi:7953", "url": "https://travel.sygic.com/en/poi/skerryvore-poi:7953"}, {"title": "canmore.org.uk", "url": "https://canmore.org.uk/event/855050"}, {"title": "Skerryvore Lighthouse", "url": "https://lighthouseaccommodation.co.uk/listings/skerryvore-lighthouse/"}, {"title": "djo.org.uk", "url": "https://djo.org.uk/household-words/volume-ii/page-378.html"}, {"title": "www.scottish-places.info", "url": "https://www.scottish-places.info/features/featurefirst6484.html"}, {"title": "Monuments: Skerryvore Lighthouse", "url": "https://www.historytoday.com/node/46935"}, {"title": "wikipedia.classicistranieri.com", "url": "https://wikipedia.classicistranieri.com/en/articles/s/k/e/Skerr